flowchart TD
  title["Intended journey. The prototype does not ask for this ID and does not call AI."]

  s1["1. The learner finishes the course"]
  s2["2. A Course Completion record is created. This is not a proof 180 Certificate."]
  s3["3. The learner enters that record's ID"]
  gate{"4. Can this record be assessed?"}

  stop["Stop. No proof 180 Certificate."]
  why["The ID is invalid, it belongs to someone else, the course data is missing, there is no assessment design, the version is too old, or no attempts remain."]
  already["Already pending, returned, or issued. Show that status. Do not start another assessment."]

  s5["5. Load the course, version, objectives, materials, specialization, and history"]
  s6["6. Planned: AI writes questions from this course and its criteria only"]
  gen{"7. Did question generation succeed?"}
  badGen["Stop. Do not replace the course with unrelated questions."]
  s8["8. Save the assessment. Default 5 questions, up to 7. That count is an assumption, not a tested rule."]

  s9["9. The learner reads the rules, the time limit, the attempt limit, and consents"]
  s10["10. The learner answers and submits. Policy assumption: one first attempt and one retry. A hidden tab may be noted. It does not prove cheating."]
  s11["11. demo_evaluator_v1 proposes a result. A score is not a certificate."]
  s12["12. The attempt waits in Pending Review"]

  s13["13. The reviewer reads the answers, the rubric, the evidence, and the proposal"]
  decide{"14. The reviewer records a written decision"}
  issued["15. Approve. Issue one proof 180 Certificate with its own public ID."]
  denied["Reject. Not Verified / Not Issued. The completion record is unchanged."]
  returned["Return for further review"]

  s16["16. The learner sees the status, and opens the certificate only if it was issued"]
  s17["17. An employer partner checks the certificate ID. Answers and reviewer notes stay hidden."]

  title --> s1 --> s2 --> s3 --> gate
  gate -->|No| stop --> why
  gate -->|Already underway| already
  gate -->|Yes| s5 --> s6 --> gen
  gen -->|No| badGen
  gen -->|Yes| s8 --> s9 --> s10 --> s11 --> s12 --> s13 --> decide
  decide -->|Approve| issued --> s16 --> s17
  decide -->|Reject| denied --> s16
  decide -->|Return| returned --> s13
